\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Payload audit of real serialized update sizes. Frozen-$A$ clients upload only the trainable $B$ factor (1{,}408 parameters per rank column); the $A{+}B$ column is the joint-training equivalent. The stylized $s(r)$ column lists the protocol reused as a normalized-cost cell in Section~\ref {sec:simsim}.}}{18}{}\protected@file@percent }
