\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Real-trainer experiments (non-IID CIFAR-10 unless stated). Accuracy is round-40 test accuracy; timely delivery ratio, bytes per round (rounds 30--39, attempted uplink), and mean delivered rank follow the definitions of Section~\ref {sec:eval}. (a) Deadline ladder. (b) Extended stress matrix, five seeds. (c) External baselines, ten seeds except the two FP16 rows (five seeds). (d) Scheduling arms, 1.0\,MB budget. (e) Component ablations, five seeds.}}{20}{}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:trainermain}{{3}{20}{}{}{}}
\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Real-trainer experiments (CIFAR-10, means over seeds). (a)~At the nominal deadline all rank policies hold the pretrained-backbone accuracy. (b)~Under the 0.1\,s deadline all methods remain stable while full-model updates deliver nothing and stay at the backbone. (c)~FedRAS is link-aware: delivered rank holds 16, tracks 13, and tracks 8 under the 2.0, 0.1, and 0.05\,s deadlines, against the fixed annealing schedule of the SA-FedLoRA-style baseline. (d)~Final accuracy across datasets; the parity is not CIFAR-10-specific (numbers in Table~\ref {tab:trainermain}(b)).}}{21}{}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:trainermain}{{2}{21}{}{}{}}
