\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Delivered-update norm vs.\ rank on CIFAR-10 (mean over delivered rounds; five seeds per point, error bars are one standard deviation). The measured growth ($2.5\times $ from rank 2 to 16, $1.9\times $ from rank 4 to 16) tracks the square-root capacity law of \eqref  {eq:cap} ($2.8\times $ and $2.0\times $) rather than linear payload growth ($8\times $ and $4\times $); the nominal and stress series coincide.}}{22}{}\protected@file@percent }
